  "source": "[\\empty.set]\nDefines: X is \\set\nexpresses:\n. not:\n  . exists: Y is \\\\anything\n    suchThat: Y \"in\" X\nDocumented:\n. called: \"empty set\"\n. written: \"\\emptyset\"\n. description: \"The empty set $\\emptyset$ is the unique set having no members\n                whatsoever. It is the seed from which the entire universe of\n                sets -- and eventually the natural number $0$ -- is grown.\"\nId: \"96908ddf-5fc5-455d-9cfd-eaf0fd6ada38\"",
